  "rte": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Fully threaded PEEK or titanium anchor with tapered needles to provide stability. Gravity anchors may be used to address a variety of soft tissue applications that span the forefoot, midfoot and hindfoot.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Gravity suture anchor</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Available in 2.7 mm, 3.5 mm and 5.5 mm sizes</li>\n<li>Aggressive self-cutting flutes to support ease of anchor insertion<sup>1</sup></li>\n<li>Contain Ultra-High Molecular Weight Polyethylene sutures</li>\n<li>Modular handle design allows for organized suture and needle deployment</li>\n<li>Platform instruments work with all Gravity implants</li>\n<li>Available in titanium or PEEK-Optima</li>\n</ul>\n",
